OL,3,GNEWSATom Cullen says he doesn't take
OL,4,Athe 'privilege' of playing LGBT roles
OL,5,Alightly
OL,6,
OL,7,FTom Cullen says he does not take the
OL,8,F"privilege" of playing a gay character
OL,9,Flightly.
OL,11,FSpeaking at the screening of
OL,12,Fmystery-thriller Black Church Bay at
OL,13,Fthe Iris Prize Festival, the Downton
OL,14,FAbbey and House of the Dragon actor
OL,15,Fsaid representation mattered.
OL,17,FIn the film, Cullen, from Aberystwyth,
OL,18,FCeredigion, plays a closeted man who
OL,19,Ffinds he will go to any lengths to keep
OL,20,Fup appearances in his insular
OL,21,Fcommunity.
